    "detailed_description": "Bella's mission to restore hope and hunting for a vaccine is risky. She cannot do this on her own. So, she needs the best sidekick, you. Grab your gun, and let's rock and roll.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>About Shooting Covid!</strong></u></h2>Shooting Covid! is a Virus Shooting Game, single-player. Let's take one's place of Bella and blast the viruses!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924270/extras/6fc9aa0e50d5579864363542f0c3453f.avif?t=1673016421\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An unlimited shooting game. There are several bullets in your hand. <br></li><li> Hunting the viruses to collect items and trade them at the front gate to discover your next adventure. <br></li><li> Save the world. Kill the boss and stop spreading the viruses and searching for a vaccine. <br></li><li> Don't forget to collect the snacks along the way. You may need them.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924270/extras/b2d3145efe19a404f15b196649396c3d.avif?t=1673016421\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Caution! Watch your step, Infected Area!</h2>",
